<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian foreign exchange market closed.</title>
<headline>Indonesian foreign exchange market closed.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian foreign exchange market was closed on Tuesday due to the year-end holiday.</p>
<p>Dealers said on Monday the dollar-rupiah rate closed at 2,362.0/62.5, against an opening of 2,363.0/64.25. This compared with an opening of 2,281.0/83.0 on January 2 this year.</p>
<p>The market resumes trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
